Skip qa_FirDecimator: includes a header that doesn't exist upstream

blocks/filter/include/gnuradio-4.0/filter/FirDecimator.hpp includes
<gnuradio-4.0/algorithm/filter/FilterTool.hpp>, which is not present
anywhere in the gr4-incubator tree at this commit (algorithm/ only
provides pmt_converter). This breaks any build with ENABLE_TESTING=ON.
Drop the one test target that pulls this header in until upstream adds
the missing file.

Upstream-Status: Pending

